{"id":22232,"author":"Brokennz","body":"\u003cb\u003eHello!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eWelcome to \u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eCrop Valley\u003c/u\u003e, \u003c/b\u003emy second map for the Avicus Network. In this map, I tried to improve a lot thanks by the feedback that some really cool people gave me.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe map is planned for 20v20 or 15v15 (highly recommended). It contains three monuments called Monument A, B and C.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u0026gt;\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHere is a picture about Crop Valley \u0026nbsp;(in the Imgur album you can see\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eall\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;the pictures from it).\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/aquD49I.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/aquD49I.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eFeatures:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eNot OCN style this time.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eIron (64x2)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eCool layout o:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eLinks:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/spa