created_at":1464600578},{"id":305629,"author":"Brokennz","body":"@ImRaging; Thanks for your feedback. In future versions I will add more Islands and maybe remove one Monument.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThanks to all the people for the feedback!\u003c/b\u003e","body_tagged":"@ImRaging; Thanks for your feedback. In future versions I will add more Islands and maybe remove one Monument.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThanks to all the people for the feedback!\u003c/b\u003e","created_at":1464636862},{"id":305666,"author":"keller183","body":"ikr i was expecting like a field and a barn n shit xd\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003edis map looks cool tho deres a lot of quarts, could use stained clay as well","body_tagged":"ikr i was expecting like a field and a barn n shit xd\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003edis map looks cool tho deres a lot of quarts, could use stained clay as well","created_at":1464643113,"reply_to":305480},{"id":305721,"author":"MerlinMaster","body":"Pretty shit","body_tagged":"Pretty shit","created_at":1464663388},{"id":305725,"author":"steven5703","body":"Prove it","body_tagged":"Prove it","created_at":1464664286,"reply_to":305721},{"id":305758,"author":"ProddyyUwU","body":"I can make the YML :D","body_tagged":"I can make the YML :D","created_at":1464680157},{"id":305830,"author":"Legoche","body":"I do quite like the layout and block pallet, maybe add more structures to make it more flat like trees. I'd suggest removing the mid monument. At the moment it seems pretty easy to defend and hard to mine the monument on, so maybe add a quicker pick.","body_tagged":"I do quite like the layout and block pallet, maybe add more structures to make it more flat like trees. I'd suggest removing the mid monument. At the moment it seems pretty easy to defend and hard to mine the monument on, so maybe add a quicker pick.","created_at":1464705928},{"id":305833,"author":"Wahiz","body":"Nice! \u0026lt;3","body_tagged":"Nice! \u0026lt;3","created_at":1464707291},